#### From mathcomp Require Import all_ssreflect all_algebra. From mathcomp Require Import reals geometry euclid. Set Implicit Arguments. Unset Strict Implicit. Unset Printing Implicit Defensive. Local Open Scope ring_scope. Variable R : realType. Variables A B C : 'rV[R]_2. Definition D : 'rV[R]_2 := ((B + C) / 2)%R. Definition E : 'rV[R]_2 := ((A + B) / 2)%R. Parameter P : 'rV[R]_2. Hypothesis HP1 : colinear A D P /\ colinear C E P. Hypothesis HP2 : exists t1 t2 : R, 0 < t1 < 1 /\ 0 < t2 < 1 /\ P = (1 - t1) *: A + t1 *: D /\ P = (1 - t2) *: C + t2 *: E. Hypothesis HPE : norm (P - E) = 1.5. Hypothesis HPD : norm (P - D) = 2. Hypothesis HDE : norm (D - E) = 2. Theorem median_lengths_consistency : 1.5^2 + 2^2 = 2^2 + (P - E) *m (P - D)^T 0 0. Proof. Admitted.
